[Desktop Entry]
# Hearth Reader: KDE Okular with Hearth's colors (hosts/hearth-kde, docs/KDE-APPS.md). GPL; KDE credited in its About.
Name=Reader
GenericName=Document Viewer
Comment=Read and mark up PDFs, e-books, comic books and other documents
Exec=okular %U
TryExec=okular
Icon=hearth-reader
Type=Application
Categories=Qt;KDE;Office;Viewer;Graphics;
MimeType=application/pdf;application/epub+zip;application/x-cbz;application/vnd.comicbook+zip;application/x-cbr;application/vnd.comicbook-rar;application/postscript;image/vnd.djvu;image/vnd.djvu+multipage;application/x-fictionbook+xml;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text;application/xps;application/oxps;
Keywords=pdf;document;viewer;reader;ebook;epub;book;comic;okular;annotate;sign;
StartupNotify=true
StartupWMClass=org.kde.okular
X-Hearth-Based-On=org.kde.okular.desktop
